      "text": "The BC Ministry of Education and Child Care school list shows 68 schools with a Burnaby street address: 58 public schools and 10 independent schools. It also shows 5 college and university campuses. In that list, 12 schools marked as offering French Immersion, 4 alternate programs and 1 online school."
