      "text": "The list includes alternate programs, continuing education centres and online schools that have a street address, so the totals run higher than the number of neighbourhood schools; they sit under \"other public schools and programs\" below. The Ministry's own level field also mislabels some secondary schools as elementary, so this page reads the level from the school's name."
